What is Loop:
A programming Rule that Repeats a set of steps over and over

- A loop Runs the same code over and over again , as long as the Condition is true.

Why :we use loops to Repeat a set of instructions

-Reduce Coad duplication
Process large amount of Data Efficiently
To save time and easy readablity

How : Loop is a programming control structure used to run a Block of code over and over again until specific Condition.

Real-life Ex :
-Music Player - play songs in loop
-Alarm snoozing 
-sensor Checking
-operating system 
-light blink neavigation
